@startuml
' Figure 23.6  The input contract
' Reading order: top to bottom. A Contract names a modality and an
' owner, lists its fields, and has no free-text field. The edge admits
' a RawInput against it and returns an Envelope; only an Envelope
' renders into context. From inputs.contract and inputs.edge.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
class Contract <<policy>> {
  +modality
  +owner
  +free_text = False
}
class Field <<policy>> {
  +pattern
  +accept_at, review_at
  +check
}
class RawInput <<knowledge>> {
  +layers
  +extracted
}
class Envelope <<evidence>> {
  +trust = untrusted
  +provenance
  +fields, signals
  +route()
}
Contract *-down- Field
RawInput .right.> Contract : against
RawInput -down-> Envelope : admit()
@enduml
